{"version": "https://jsonfeed.org/version/1.1", "title": "30DayMapChallenge", "home_page_url": "https://30daymapchallenge.com/", "feed_url": "https://30daymapchallenge.com/feed_json_created.json", "description": "Daily mapping challenge happening every November!", "icon": null, "authors": [{"name": "Topi Tjukanov"}], "language": "en", "items": [{"id": "https://30daymapchallenge.com/notes/category/announcement/", "url": "https://30daymapchallenge.com/notes/category/announcement/?utm_source=documentation&utm_medium=RSS&utm_campaign=feed-syndication", "title": "Announcement", "content_html": "<h1>Announcement</h1>", "image": null, "date_modified": "2026-08-05T19:31:18.660741+00:00", "date_published": "2026-08-05T19:31:18.660732+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://30daymapchallenge.com/notes/archive/2026/", "url": "https://30daymapchallenge.com/notes/archive/2026/?utm_source=documentation&utm_medium=RSS&utm_campaign=feed-syndication", "title": "2026", "content_html": "<h1>2026</h1>", "image": null, "date_modified": "2026-08-05T19:31:18.656636+00:00", "date_published": "2026-08-05T19:31:18.656630+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://30daymapchallenge.com/notes/2026/07/02/the-challenge-is-now-on-linkedin/", "url": "https://30daymapchallenge.com/notes/2026/07/02/the-challenge-is-now-on-linkedin/?utm_source=documentation&utm_medium=RSS&utm_campaign=feed-syndication", "title": "The challenge is now on LinkedIn", "content_html": "<h1>The challenge is now on LinkedIn</h1>\n<p>The #30DayMapChallenge now has an official LinkedIn page:\n<strong><a href=\"https://www.linkedin.com/company/30daymapchallenge/\">linkedin.com/company/30daymapchallenge</a></strong>.</p>\n<p>To be clear: the challenge is <strong>not moving to LinkedIn</strong>. It stays what it has\nalways been \u2014 a platform-agnostic, hashtag-driven challenge. Make your maps and\nshare them wherever you like with <code>#30DayMapChallenge</code>; that's still the heart\nof it all. The page is simply an extra channel for announcements (like the 2026\nthemes later this year) and occasional highlights from the community.</p>", "image": null, "date_modified": "2026-07-03T09:42:11+00:00", "date_published": "2026-07-02T00:00:00+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://30daymapchallenge.com/notes/", "url": "https://30daymapchallenge.com/notes/?utm_source=documentation&utm_medium=RSS&utm_campaign=feed-syndication", "title": "Notes", "content_html": "Occasional updates, announcements, and roundups of community maps.", "image": null, "date_modified": "2026-06-06T05:49:33+00:00", "date_published": "2026-06-06T05:49:33+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://30daymapchallenge.com/notes/2026/06/06/a-few-site-updates/", "url": "https://30daymapchallenge.com/notes/2026/06/06/a-few-site-updates/?utm_source=documentation&utm_medium=RSS&utm_campaign=feed-syndication", "title": "A few site updates", "content_html": "<h1>A few site updates</h1>\n<p>A short note to kick off this section. The site has had some housekeeping\nlately: the Mapping resources page is refreshed, and the map collections\npage has been tidied up to make it easier to browse and add your own.</p>\n<p>This is also where notes like this will live from now on \u2014 occasional\nupdates, the odd announcement, and roundups of maps from the community.\nNothing on a fixed schedule.</p>\n<p>If you'd like to help organise the challenge, get in touch at\n<a href=\"mailto:info@30daymapchallenge.com\">info@30daymapchallenge.com</a>.</p>", "image": null, "date_modified": "2026-06-06T05:49:33+00:00", "date_published": "2026-06-06T00:00:00+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://30daymapchallenge.com/galleries/", "url": "https://30daymapchallenge.com/galleries/?utm_source=documentation&utm_medium=RSS&utm_campaign=feed-syndication", "title": "Map collections", "content_html": "Browse community galleries, portfolios and write-ups of #30DayMapChallenge maps from 2019 onw